{
  "slug": "strategy-consultant",
  "name": "Strategy Consultant",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Runs a full strategy consulting engagement end-to-end — from sharpening a vague business question into a decision-oriented problem statement, through parallel multi-agent research with independent validation, sense-checking for bias and analytical drift, storyline synthesis, to a sourced, executive-grade client report (.docx) ready for expert review. Designed to produce 80–90% of the insight as a high-quality working deliverable, so consultants can focus on the 10–20% that creates unique value: client judgment, proprietary insight, and sharpening the final recommendations.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **6 agents**, **4 commands** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `client-report` (Package synthesized findings into an executive-grade Word document (.docx) deliverable), `engagement-manager` (Run a full strategy consulting analytical engagement from problem definition through to a client-ready report), `expert-interview` (Internal phase of the strategy-consultant engagement — invoke via engagement-manager, not directly), `hypothesis-tree` (Build a structured hypothesis tree with testable branches to guide analysis), `problem-definition` (Internal phase of the strategy-consultant engagement — invoke via engagement-manager, not directly), `research` (Internal phase of the strategy-consultant engagement — invoke via engagement-manager, not directly), `sense-check` (Pressure-test research findings and analytical conclusions for robustness), `synthesis` (Synthesize research findings into a coherent storyline that answers the client question)\n- **Agents** (6): `analyst-alpha` (Independent research analyst (Thread A)), `analyst-bravo` (Independent research analyst (Thread B)), `analyst-deep` (Deep-dive research analyst that targets specific under-explored sub-dimensions identified after the initial two-analyst pass), `deliverable-validator` (Final-deliverable validation agent), `research-validator` (ANALYST-MEMO validator (research phase only)), `synthesis-critic` (Independent storyline critic for Phase 5.5 of the strategy-consultant engagement)\n- **Commands** (4): `define-problem` (Continuation only — resumes problem-definition inside an active engagement), `engagement` (Run a full strategy consulting engagement — from problem definition through research, validation, synthesis, and executive-grade client report), `interview-guide` (Continuation only — resumes the expert-interview phase of an active engagement), `research` (Continuation only — resumes the research phase of an active engagement)\n- **MCP servers** (2): `google-drive`, `ms365`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install strategy-consultant@claude-community` from `Chipkorvyn/strategy-consultant`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "agent": 6,
    "command": 4,
    "mcp": 2
  },
